      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.79,
      "end_seconds": 30.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Since yesterday, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.3,
      "end_seconds": 39.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.59,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.6,
      "end_seconds": 54.43,
      "duration_seconds": 12.83,
      "text": "It feels moderate to me. I notice it more with missed tablets. It's every other day. And, And I've been feeling groggy afterwards as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.32,
      "end_seconds": 59.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
